When a single hit deals more than [32%, 25%, 21%, 18%, 16% (TL1-5; PARADOX 300)] of your maximum life another you appears and takes [13%, 31%, 42%, 49%, 54% (TL1-5; PARADOX 300)] of the damage as well as [6%, 15%, 21%, 24%, 27% (TL1-5; PARADOX 300)] of all damage you take for the next 2 turns.

The clone is out of phase with this reality and deals 50% less damage but its arrows will pass through friendly targets.

This talent has a cooldown.
